				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>入力できる　数字は
４文字　まで　です</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-26T07:09:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
